    "chapter_hd": "Dlo chaa vapu chwenjweng rapu Davidnanh Benjamin mihcheh Cush nganaang symānma̲kpu Shuree za̲k ronnang sarapu lan.",
    "chapter_en": "Shiggaion of David, which he sang unto the LORD, concerning the words of Cush the Benjamite.",
    "chapter_mm": "အခန်း ၇",
    "book_name": "Psalms",
    "book_id": 19,
    "text_hd": "Sheevapu zeigha sareng saye lehket pulee sayeo.",
    "text_en": "He hath also prepared for him the instruments of death; he ordaineth his arrows against the persecutors.",
    "text_mm": "သေစေသော လက်နက်ကိုလည်း သူ့အဘို့ ပြင်ဆင်၍ မြှားတော်တို့ကို လောင်စေတော်မူ၏။",
    "verse_number": 13,
