    "chapter_hd": "Dlo chaa vapu chwenjweng rapu Davidnanh Benjamin mihcheh Cush nganaang symānma̲kpu Shuree za̲k ronnang sarapu lan.",
    "chapter_en": "Shiggaion of David, which he sang unto the LORD, concerning the words of Cush the Benjamite.",
