    "book_name": "Psalms",
    "book_id": 19,
    "text_hd": "Amanglhaa nang chhoura ninyaa lhalhā tayerou chhoura apewnsuih shungnang yueyueta ngou cha rou hananh symānma̲kpu Shuree nang jhāngye mey yeo avei gang nihrapu mihpu avei Shureenang chendiket lenneiu.",
    "text_en": "Why art thou cast down, O my soul? and why art thou disquieted within me? hope in God: for I shall yet praise him, who is the health of my countenance, and my God. To the chief Musician for the sons of Korah, Maschil.",
