    "chapter_hd": "Oh Deimei Shuree, Deimei mih- pu vey chenka gadhung pu- naang picheree sathuih vapu vangpulhaa Shenshen nitrou.Divaang lhaapāng chwenjweng rapoh.",
    "chapter_mm": "အခန်း ၇၂",
    "book_name": "Psalms",
