    "book_id": 19,
    "text_hd": "Ba̲lihnanhh zanga kakennei feng kāye, shunpa ka̲shuk punang gatuk kenlennei douhra ka̲shuk puvey hwā ka̲shipu theiye dimih nanh ka̲dhengnei sychheng kaphā lennou.",
