    "book_name": "Psalms",
    "book_id": 19,
    "text_hd": "Beivei rwey pungnang raang veirou beivei gadhung pudou ngou yangrou.",
    "text_mm": "ထိုသူ၏ အိမ်၌ စည်းစိမ်ဥစ္စာကြွယ်ဝ၍၊ သူ၏ ကောင်းကျိုးသည် အစဉ်အမြဲတည်တတ်၏။",
    "verse_number": 3,
    "text_en": "Wealth and riches shall be in his house: and his righteousness endureth for ever.",
